      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_cb0da7fd",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: bitches_be_like_he_got_money_though; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a Black couple sleeping peacefully in bed. The overlaid text reads \"bitches be like..\" and \"he got money though.\" This meme uses a racialized stereotype to imply that Black women are primarily motivated by financial gain, suggesting they are only attracted to men for their wealth. This is a harmful and hateful trope that reduces Black women to a stereotype based on their race and gender, implying they are shallow or materialistic. The meme perpetuates a negative racialized and misogynistic stereotype, targeting Black women by associating them with greed and financial motivation, which is a form of racial and gender-based hate. The intent is to mock and demean Black women by implying their relationships are transactional and based solely on wealth, which is a harmful and hateful message.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_453c5ee5"
      },
